WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.160
- Everyone needs a little pick-me-up,

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.640
a pat on the back, or the old high five.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.580
And here's a little dose
of you-can-do-it energy

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.400
from someone we love.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.740
- I just heard the coolest metaphor

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.470
and I wanna share it with you guys.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.540
You could be the whole package

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.030
and still get delivered
to the wrong address.

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.030
And then when that happens,

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.140
the receiver is gonna mishandle you

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.970
because they don't know
what to do with you.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.330
They weren't meant to get
you in the first place

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.330
so they don't value you enough.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.100
So bottom line, you're the whole package.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.520
You're either just at the wrong
house or still on the truck.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.553
- I feel more motivated already!

